WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.820
Hello, everyone at UCI,
my dear friends in Irvine.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:08.900
I'm in [city name unclear],
in Thailand.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.220
I'm catching a plane now,
just for you.

4
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.680
I'm coming to Irvine.
We have a Yalda party together.

5
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.080
We want to [unclear] together.
I love you all.

6
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.040
I hope to see every one of you.

7
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.740
As I said,
we want to [unclear].

8
00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.520
Where's my plane?

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.700
[Indistinct words]

9
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:34.900
I have to go now. I just wanted to say
I love you. See you Saturday night,

10
00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.780
December 15.

11
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.400
I love you.
